#
# The pinned ExifTool (spec 1 §9.3, TRD-23). Sourced by fetch.sh and smoke_test.sh; keep it plain
# KEY=value lines so it is also bash-sourceable. See README.md for how to bump it.
#
# NOT PINNED YET. The values below are empty because the pin needs the newest release and the
# SHA-256 of each file as downloaded, and that could not be fetched from the implementation
# environment. fetch.sh refuses to run until they are filled in.

EXIFTOOL_VERSION=""
EXIFTOOL_UNIX_URL=""
EXIFTOOL_UNIX_SHA256=""
EXIFTOOL_WINDOWS_URL=""
EXIFTOOL_WINDOWS_SHA256=""
EXIFTOOL_WINDOWS_MIRROR=""
